## ADDITIONAL NOTICE (Non-binding intent)

This software is intended as a **symbolic framework / tension revealer**, not
a prediction engine or fortune-telling product. The author requests (but does
not legally require) that derivative works:

- Do NOT use this for political prediction, election forecasting, or
  personal-attack divination
- Do NOT use this for gambling / betting / lottery prediction
- Do NOT use this as the sole basis for medical, legal, or major life
  decisions
- DO preserve the philosophical anchors in SKILL.md (no event prediction,
  no fatalism, no health prediction)

如果你做了违反精神的衍生品，作者的脸要丢不丢，是你的事。但请别说是受这套框架启发。
